      <lb n="10"/>אברם בחרן.   ואחר יצא <gap reason="lost" extent="unknown"/><unclear cert="low">א</unclear>רץ כנען שש<unclear cert="high">י</unclear><supplied reason="lost">ם</supplied><gap reason="lost" extent="unknown"/>.
      <lb n="11"/>העגלה והאיל וה<unclear cert="low">ע</unclear><supplied reason="lost">ז</supplied><gap reason="lost" extent="unknown"/> אברם לא<gap reason="lost" extent="unknown"/>
